.TH CHM-KNOWLEDGE-DAEMON 1 "2026-09-23" "Chimera II OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
chm-knowledge-daemon \- staged public-information knowledge pipeline
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chm-knowledge-daemon
[once]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates and maintains the Chimera knowledge-fabric staging areas. Network retrieval is disabled unless administrator policy enables CHIMERA_KNOWLEDGE_ENABLE=1.
Downloaded content is treated as data, not executable code.
